DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43045::$$$message_0356_0000_0000$$$::"...Souichirou, where are you?"::
43046::$$$message_0356_0000_0001$$$::"...Hehe. I wonder if he'll be surprised at this invitation."::
43047::$$$message_0356_0000_0002$$$::"...No, I'm sure he's the only man who wouldn't be.[lr]::
43048::$$$message_0356_0000_0003$$$::[hffacechg chara=キャスター face=楽 layer=0 time=200]Ah, Souichirou...?"::
43049::$$$message_0356_0001_0000$$$::"..."::
43050::$$$message_0356_0001_0001$$$::"..."::
43051::$$$message_0356_0001_0002$$$::"W-what is happening... Souichirou and that good-for-nothing are staring each other down!"::
43052::$$$message_0356_0001_0003$$$::"...Checkmate."::
43053::$$$message_0356_0001_0004$$$::"...Hm. I do appear to be in a bind. I don't think I can win now."::
43054::$$$message_0356_0001_0005$$$::"...W-[hfchance layer=0]what do you think you're doing, Assassin!?"::
43055::$$$message_0356_0001_0006$$$::"Hm? Do you know this man, Caster?"::
43056::$$$message_0356_0001_0007$$$::"Not exactly... But what is happening?"::
43057::$$$message_0356_0001_0008$$$::"As you can see, Souichirou and I are acquainted in this way."::
43058::$$$message_0356_0001_0009$$$::"Yes. We are 'besties,' to use the modern parlance."::
43059::$$$message_0356_0001_0010$$$::"...I see... (I'll strangle him later.) Well, Souichirou, would you like to go out with me?"::
43060::$$$message_0356_0001_0011$$$::"I don't mind. Where?"::
43061::$$$message_0356_0001_0012$$$::"The abbot recommended a good onsen resort to me."::
43062::$$$message_0356_0001_0013$$$::"Onsen? That sounds quite tasteful, Souichirou."::
43063::$$$message_0356_0001_0014$$$::"Tasteful? ...I struggle to understand."::
43064::$$$message_0356_0001_0015$$$::"Oh, Assassin. Are you interested in onsen as well?"::
43065::$$$message_0356_0001_0016$$$::"As one also born in this land, I can only say it is tragic that you lack your countrymen's interest in bathing."::
43066::$$$message_0356_0001_0017$$$::"Then will you be joining us?"::
43067::$$$message_0356_0001_0018$$$::"Hm? What brings this sudden change of heart? I would think you were against the notion of anyone interrupting your time with your husband."::
43068::$$$message_0356_0001_0019$$$::"Oh, sometimes the mood strikes me...[wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=不満 layer=0 time=200] If I'm lucky, Saber might come and attack."::
43069::$$$message_0356_0001_0020$$$::"...What was that?"::
43070::$$$message_0356_0001_0021$$$::"No, nothing."::
43071::$$$message_0356_0001_0022$$$::"But surely you haven't forgotten that I can't leave the mountain gate."::
43072::$$$message_0356_0001_0023$$$::"Oh, that?[wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se042.wav][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=喜 time=200][hfchance layer=0] ...Voila."::
43073::$$$message_0356_0001_0024$$$::"...Hm?"::
43074::$$$message_0356_0001_0025$$$::"I've transferred your Master rights from the gate to Souichirou's glasses. Protect him until we return."::
43075::$$$message_0356_0001_0026$$$::"That sounds ominous."::
43076::$$$message_0356_0001_0027$$$::"Then shall we go, Souichirou?"::
43077::$$$message_0356_0001_0028$$$::"Mm."::
�